.el .ds Aq '
.TH "bead resource list" 1  "bead resource list " 
.SH NAME
bead resource list \- List declared local resource keys
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbead resource list\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List normalized resource declarations for an issue.
.PP
The result describes scheduling keys in this native workspace only. Resource
declarations are not distributed\-lock state and do not describe another
workspace.
.PP
EXAMPLE:
  bead resource list <ID> \-\-json
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
Issue ID
